cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this research software, please cite the version-specific archived
  software release and acknowledge the original SAE J1939 dataset provider.
title: >-
  Operating-State-Conditioned Physical Residual Anomaly Detection from SAE
  J1939 for Heavy-Duty Diesel Powertrains: Reproducibility Code
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Firdaus
    given-names: Sukma
    affiliation: >-
      Program Studi Diploma 4 Teknologi Rekayasa Pemeliharaan Alat Berat,
      Politeknik Negeri Tanah Laut
version: 1.0.0-paper
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/sukmapolitala/j1939-powertrain-physical-residual
keywords:
  - SAE J1939
  - heavy-duty diesel powertrain
  - physical residual
  - operating-state conditioning
  - anomaly detection
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Reproducibility software for an operating-state-conditioned physical residual
  detector based on SAE J1939 heavy-duty diesel powertrain telemetry.
  The repository includes author-created decoding and analysis code, experimental
  configurations, tests, and aggregate evaluation results. Original third-party
  recordings and record-level derived physical measurements are not redistributed
  because their redistribution permissions have not been verified.
